# Faroe Islands: the FO orthophoto of Umhvørvisstovan wherever it has data
# (Extents/Faroe), Esri World Imagery (Arc) beyond it, i.e. on the open sea.
# FO is sharper than GO2, Arc and BI on the islands (compared at ZL16 and
# ZL18 at Vágar, Tórshavn, Tvøroyri, Eiði, Gásadalur and Slættaratindur,
# 2026-11-24) and has no watermark.

FO     Faroe     none    high
Arc    global    none    high
